Actually, the simplest and most robust approach in 25 is to implement `BeforeEnterObserver` in the root view:

```java
@Route("")
public class MainView extends Div implements BeforeEnterObserver {
    @Override
    public void beforeEnter(BeforeEnterEvent event) {
        event.forwardTo("contact");
    }
}
```

